{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52008","headline":"春晚园林 · 王绩","name":"春晚园林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不道嫌朝隐，无情受陆沉。\n忽逢今旦乐，还遂少时心。\n卷书藏箧笥，移榻就园林。\n老妻能劝酒，少子解弹琴。\n落花随处下，春鸟自须吟。\n兀然成一醉，谁知怀抱深？\n（按：《客野丛书》卷十九录「老妻能劝酒，少子解弹琴」二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}